title: Drawers integration
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The [[Drawers plugin|https://drawers.tiddlyhost.com/]] is an excellent way to get a quick view to your tasks, especially on mobile.

You can import the self-contained [[Drawers/GSD]] to your wiki which is specially made for this purpose, and add it to either sidebar from the Drawers settings (''Appearance'' → ''Drawers'').